 "input": "MOT day at the garage. customer books online or rings, it goes in the test bay calendar. tester has to be logged into the MOT testing service before starting, every result gets recorded there. the test itself: lights, brakes, emissions, tyres etc, tester follows the inspection manual. emissions needs the gas analyser and it has to be calibrated (calibration certificate on the wall, renewed yearly). if it passes, certificate printed from the testing service. if it fails we give them a refusal sheet and quote for repairs, workshop does the repair, then partial retest within 10 working days is free. fee is capped by the government, reception takes payment.",
